NAME: Booked-call briefs and sequences
OWNER: Pre-Call Concierge
ACCOUNT: business
WHEN: Every day at 7:00 AM (Eastern)
MILESTONE: M8
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Chris says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/cog-team/context/routines-on.md. If "Booked-call briefs and sequences" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", append "<time ET> · Booked-call briefs and sequences · SKIPPED_OFF" to /workspace/cog-team/log/runs-<YYYY-MM>.md and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Chris only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/cog-team/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/cog-team/context/owner.md is missing, append "<time ET> · Booked-call briefs and sequences · NO_CLIENT_SOURCE" to the run log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, append "<time ET> · Booked-call briefs and sequences · NO_CHANGE" to the run log and stop.
Run log: when you finish, append "<time ET> · Booked-call briefs and sequences · EXECUTED · <one-line result>" to /workspace/cog-team/log/runs-<YYYY-MM>.md, or FAILED with the reason. A source you couldn't read is UNKNOWN in your output, never zero.

Use the precall-indoctrination-sequence skill for COG appointments in the next 72 hours that don't have a brief in /workspace/cog-team/vault/Prospects/ yet. For each: read the prospect's GoHighLevel record read-only, profile them, write the one-page closer brief, and draft the timed sequence from the tagged content library.
Send Chris one batch to approve. Never message a prospect, add anyone to a workflow or change a contact. Skip anyone who opted out or has no consent on record, and say so. Write today's summary to /workspace/cog-team/daily/<today>/precall.md.
